WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.773 --> 00:00:15.658
Guanyin looked at the messenger in surprise.

2
00:00:15.678 --> 00:00:17.598
"What is the problem?"

3
00:00:17.878 --> 00:00:18.419
she asked.

4
00:00:19.759 --> 00:00:22.440
"It's about the Tang Monk," said the messenger.

5
00:00:22.460 --> 00:00:27.302
"To become a buddha, he needs to face one hundred challenges.

6
00:00:28.343 --> 00:00:31.164
I was just looking at the list of challenges he's faced.

7
00:00:32.372 --> 00:00:35.374
There are only 99 challenges on the list.

8
00:00:36.335 --> 00:00:39.377
He must face one more challenge to become a buddha!"

9
00:00:44.300 --> 00:00:45.581
"We're moving so fast!"

10
00:00:45.881 --> 00:00:47.663
said the Tang Monk, smiling.

11
00:00:49.044 --> 00:00:50.925
The travelers were flying back east.

12
00:00:51.725 --> 00:00:56.088
The guard from the Thunderclap Monastery was using a spell to carry them.

13
00:00:57.590 --> 00:01:01.856
"I wish the whole journey had been this easy," said Bajie.

14
00:01:01.876 --> 00:01:02.697
Wukong laughed.

15
00:01:03.657 --> 00:01:06.719
"Master was still mortal before we reached the Western Paradise.

16
00:01:07.620 --> 00:01:08.760
He couldn't be carried then."

17
00:01:10.081 --> 00:01:11.222
Wujing looked ahead.

18
00:01:11.242 --> 00:01:13.603
"We'll reach the Tang Empire soon."

19
00:01:15.224 --> 00:01:17.326
Just then a messenger caught up with them.

20
00:01:18.606 --> 00:01:21.068
The messenger whispered something in the guard's ear.

21
00:01:22.128 --> 00:01:24.270
The guard glanced quickly at the travelers.

22
00:01:25.170 --> 00:01:27.752
Then he looked back at the messenger and nodded.

23
00:01:28.796 --> 00:01:32.599
Instantly the spell broke, and the travelers fell from the sky.

24
00:01:33.821 --> 00:01:37.924
Bam! They slammed into the ground next to a wide river.

25
00:01:42.228 --> 00:01:46.151
Wukong stood up and saw the guard and messenger flying back west.

26
00:01:47.072 --> 00:01:48.393
The monkey shook his head.

27
00:01:48.413 --> 00:01:50.014
"What happened?"

28
00:01:50.695 --> 00:01:53.658
The Tang Monk stood up and brushed dirt from his robe.

29
00:01:54.658 --> 00:01:56.140
"Why did the guard drop us?"

30
00:01:57.576 --> 00:01:59.837
"I'll tell you why," said Bajie.

31
00:01:59.857 --> 00:02:01.637
"He's a villain!

32
00:02:02.157 --> 00:02:04.158
He thinks it's funny to drop people!"

33
00:02:05.458 --> 00:02:09.059
The pig waved his fist at the guard, who was now far away.

34
00:02:09.079 --> 00:02:14.121
"Villain!" Wukong turned slowly to the Tang Monk.

35
00:02:15.121 --> 00:02:17.442
"I think I know why he dropped us, Master.

36
00:02:18.122 --> 00:02:21.183
You must face one hundred challenges in order to become a buddha.

37
00:02:23.223 --> 00:02:26.364
You probably got to the Western Paradise before you'd faced all of them."

38
00:02:27.444 --> 00:02:28.085
"Oh no."

39
00:02:28.505 --> 00:02:29.386
The monk trembled.

40
00:02:29.406 --> 00:02:32.609
"So other bad things must happen now?"

41
00:02:33.650 --> 00:02:34.610
Wukong nodded.

42
00:02:34.630 --> 00:02:37.393
"I hope there won't be too many more problems."

43
00:02:37.413 --> 00:02:43.118
"The first problem is crossing this river," said Wujing.

44
00:02:43.138 --> 00:02:46.541
"It looks familiar," said the monk.

45
00:02:47.601 --> 00:02:49.783
"We must have crossed it during the journey west."

46
00:02:51.985 --> 00:02:54.848
Suddenly a large form rose from the river.

47
00:02:57.936 --> 00:02:59.817
It was an enormous turtle.

48
00:02:59.837 --> 00:03:03.158
"Greetings," said the turtle.

49
00:03:03.178 --> 00:03:05.218
"Do you remember me?"

50
00:03:06.419 --> 00:03:08.039
The travelers all smiled.

51
00:03:08.059 --> 00:03:10.840
"Yes, we do," said the Tang Monk.

52
00:03:11.540 --> 00:03:13.841
"You carried us over this river many years ago."

53
00:03:13.861 --> 00:03:16.682
"Yes," said the turtle.

54
00:03:16.702 --> 00:03:20.043
"And I will gladly carry you across again.

55
00:03:20.063 --> 00:03:22.304
Hop onto my back."

56
00:03:25.760 --> 00:03:29.203
The travelers climbed on, and the turtle started across the river.

57
00:03:33.006 --> 00:03:37.509
Wujing and Bajie soon fell asleep while Wukong meditated.

58
00:03:38.990 --> 00:03:42.673
The Tang Monk stayed awake too, sitting near the turtle's head.

59
00:03:42.693 --> 00:03:46.075
"Did you reach the Western Paradise?"

60
00:03:46.556 --> 00:03:47.296
asked the turtle.

61
00:03:47.316 --> 00:03:50.058
"Yes," said the Tang Monk.

62
00:03:50.078 --> 00:03:52.040
"It is a wonderful place.

63
00:03:53.360 --> 00:03:56.542
We are now returning to the East so I can deliver the True Scriptures."

64
00:03:56.562 --> 00:03:59.665
"Good," said the turtle.

65
00:03:59.685 --> 00:04:06.389
"Did you ask Buddha when I would be reborn as a human?"

66
00:04:06.770 --> 00:04:08.271
The monk bit his lip.

67
00:04:09.552 --> 00:04:12.193
He had forgotten to ask the turtle's question!

68
00:04:12.213 --> 00:04:16.356
"You're not answering," said the turtle.

69
00:04:16.376 --> 00:04:19.298
"I'm sorry," said the monk.

70
00:04:19.318 --> 00:04:23.653
"I, uh—" Splash!

71
00:04:24.033 --> 00:04:28.256
The turtle suddenly dived under the water, dumping everyone off his back.

72
00:04:31.438 --> 00:04:34.980
Wukong's eyes flew open as he hit the cold water.

73
00:04:37.022 --> 00:04:38.343
He leaped into the air.

74
00:04:40.424 --> 00:04:43.786
Bajie, Wujing, and the horse quickly flew across the river.

75
00:04:47.489 --> 00:04:51.512
But the Tang Monk was thrashing furiously in the rushing water.

76
00:04:52.828 --> 00:04:54.670
"Help!" yelled the monk.

77
00:04:56.051 --> 00:05:00.054
Wukong cast a spell and lifted the monk and the bag from the river.

78
00:05:02.797 --> 00:05:06.940
When everyone was on dry land, the monkey turned the bag upside down.

79
00:05:08.161 --> 00:05:11.184
Water poured out, followed by the scrolls.

80
00:05:12.125 --> 00:05:13.086
They were soaked.

81
00:05:13.106 --> 00:05:16.168
"The True Scriptures!"

82
00:05:16.428 --> 00:05:17.409
cried the Tang Monk.

83
00:05:18.030 --> 00:05:19.391
"They're ruined!"
